# AMS-FaceRec — Feature Plan

> **Scope:** Additional features for Admin, Teacher, and Student pages.
> **Stack:** React + TypeScript (Vite), Supabase PostgreSQL, Python Face Engine (Flask).

---

## Current State Summary

| Role | Working Pages | Placeholder Pages |
|---|---|---|
| **Admin** | Dashboard, Students, Teachers, Courses, Camera, Reports | Settings |
| **Teacher** | Dashboard, Camera, Reports | My Classes, Attendance Summary |
| **Student** | Dashboard | Attendance History, Schedule, Profile |

---

## Phase 1 — Authentication (Prerequisite for All Roles)

> All pages currently let anyone in. This must be fixed first.

**Files to change:** `routes.tsx`, `LoginPage.tsx`, new `AuthGuard.tsx`

- [ ] Wire `LoginPage.tsx` to `supabase.auth.signInWithPassword()`
- [ ] Create `<AuthGuard role="admin|teacher|student" />` wrapper component
- [ ] Wrap `/admin`, `/teacher`, `/student` route trees with the guard
- [ ] Read logged-in user's role from `user_metadata` and redirect accordingly
- [ ] Add a **Logout** button in `DashboardLayout` sidebar

---

## Phase 2 — Admin Enhancements

### 2a. System Settings Page (`/admin/settings`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

| Section | Features |
|---|---|
| **General** | Institution name, academic year, semester dates |
| **Attendance Rules** | Late threshold (minutes), minimum attendance % for warnings |
| **Face Engine** | Flask API URL, confidence threshold slider |
| **Notifications** | Toggle email alerts for low attendance |

**Files:** Create `AdminSettings.tsx`, remove from `PlaceholderPages.tsx`

---

### 2b. Admin Dashboard — Live Data Upgrades
The weekly chart and recent-activity feed currently use hardcoded static arrays.

- [ ] Fetch today's real check-in events from Supabase and render in "Recent Activity"
- [ ] Fetch this week's per-day attendance counts for the bar chart
- [ ] Make the "Active Sessions" card pull live data (courses with attendance logged today)

---

### 2c. Attendance Reports — Export

- [ ] Add **Export CSV** button → download filtered attendance table as `.csv`
- [ ] Add **Export PDF** button → use `jsPDF` + `html2canvas` to snapshot the page

---

## Phase 3 — Teacher Enhancements

### 3a. My Classes Page (`/teacher/classes`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

- [ ] List all courses assigned to the logged-in teacher (from Supabase)
- [ ] Each class card shows: code, name, schedule, room, enrolled count, attendance rate
- [ ] Click a card → expand to show the student roster for that class
- [ ] "Start Face Scan" button → links to `/teacher/camera` with pre-selected course

---

### 3b. Teacher Attendance Summary Page (`/teacher/attendance`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

- [ ] Date range picker (default: current month)
- [ ] Per-course attendance breakdown table: class → date → present / absent / late counts
- [ ] Trend bar chart per class (same style as the teacher dashboard chart)
- [ ] Manual override: allow teacher to change a student's status with a reason note
- [ ] Export CSV button for the filtered table

---

### 3c. Teacher Dashboard — Live Data Upgrades

- [ ] "Today's Attendance" student list currently shows hardcoded names → replace with real Supabase query for today's records in the selected class
- [ ] Class selector (the 3 cards) should only show courses assigned to the logged-in teacher

---

## Phase 4 — Student Pages

### 4a. Student Attendance History Page (`/student/attendance`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

- [ ] Full table of all attendance records for the logged-in student
- [ ] Filters: by course, by date range, by status (present / late / absent)
- [ ] Per-course attendance percentage shown as colored progress bars
- [ ] Warning banner if any course is below the minimum attendance threshold

---

### 4b. Student Schedule Page (`/student/schedule`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

- [ ] Weekly calendar grid view showing enrolled course timeslots
- [ ] Each slot shows: course code, room, teacher name
- [ ] Highlight today's classes
- [ ] Upcoming classes list (next 7 days) below the calendar

---

### 4c. Student Profile Page (`/student/profile`)
Replaces the current placeholder.

- [ ] Display: name, student ID, email, enrolled courses, face enrollment status
- [ ] **Change Password** form (uses `supabase.auth.updateUser`)
- [ ] Face enrollment status card — show "Enrolled ✓" or "Not enrolled" with a button to request enrollment from admin
- [ ] Profile photo upload (store in Supabase Storage)

---

### 4d. Student Dashboard — Live Data Upgrades

- [ ] Overall attendance rate stat → real query (currently placeholder `91.5`)
- [ ] "Classes Attended" → real attended / total from DB
- [ ] Course progress bars → real per-course percentages from DB
- [ ] Attendance history table → real last 10 records from DB
- [ ] Course filter dropdown → dynamically populated from enrolled courses

---

## Phase 5 — Export Features (Cross-Role)

| Feature | Roles | Library |
|---|---|---|
| CSV export for attendance tables | Admin, Teacher, Student | Native (no lib) |
| PDF export for reports | Admin, Teacher | `jsPDF` + `html2canvas` |
| PDF attendance certificate for student | Student | `jsPDF` |

---

## Phase 6 — Face Engine Integration Polish

- [ ] Live camera page: show real-time confidence score from Flask response
- [ ] After successful scan, auto-log attendance to Supabase with course + timestamp
- [ ] Error handling: clear toast message if Flask server is offline
- [ ] Add faces: trigger `add_faces.py` from the Admin "Add Student" modal via Flask API (currently the camera is a toggle placeholder)

---

## Suggested Execution Order

```
Phase 1 (Auth)
  → Phase 2a (Admin Settings)
  → Phase 3a (Teacher Classes)
  → Phase 4c (Student Profile)
  → Phase 2b + 3c + 4d (Live Data upgrades across dashboards)
  → Phase 4a (Student Attendance History)
  → Phase 4b (Student Schedule)
  → Phase 3b (Teacher Attendance Summary)
  → Phase 2c + Phase 5 (Exports)
  → Phase 6 (Face Engine Polish)
```

---

> **Note:** Tell me which phase or feature you want to start with and I'll begin building it immediately.
